WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.140
T-there it is!

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.340
What the...

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.520
Who do you take your friends for?!

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.090
There they are!

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:20.400
<i>"Anger Explosion!
Kuro vs. Luffy, How it Ends!"</i>

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:33.510
Tired?

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:37.490
<i>The Out of the Back Attack does
have lots of unnecessary movement.</i>

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.480
Don't get cocky.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:45.390
Everything so far has been playtime.

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.700
<i>You get the special treatment.</i>

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:54.430
I'm going to let you taste plenty
of fear, then slowly cook you!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:58.570
Out of the Back Attack!

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:21.830
Just try your foot technique now!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.200
Damn you! Get away from me!

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:28.500
Now your plan of three years
is a complete failure!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.100
What?!

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:33.570
He caught Captain Kuro!

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:39.140
Hey, if he wins, that means
we won't get killed, right?!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.120
Now you die!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.280
Oh, no, you don't!

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.520
You damn kids!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:58.670
<i>Looks like you're one step
too late, Haramaki!</i>

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.530
I wouldn't say so!

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:06.800
Yes! That branch was in the way!

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:09.080
What?!

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.540
<i>Usopp-san...</i>

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.550
Get 'im, Rubber Guy!

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:17.080
Kick Captain Kuro's ass!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.380
Get away!

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:24.390
You guys have no right to cheer me on!

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:27.530
Eat this, hypnotist!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:29.400
<i>Usopp-san!</i>

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.430
--Captain!
--Captain!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.070
Let go!

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.230
Gum-Gum...

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:39.000
Special Attack: Exploding Star!

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:49.540
<i>--My plan will not be disrupted!
--...Bell...</i>

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.060
H-he beat him...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.990
H-he beat Captain Kuro!

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:37.600
Not even the navy was a match for Kuro,
Man of a Thousand Plans!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.330
But he really beat him!

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.700
Just who are you?!

00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:47.000
Monkey D. Luffy.

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:53.780
I'd never lose to a pirate who ditches
his name and runs from the sea.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:58.420
The only time a pirate should
abandon his name is when he dies!

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.960
L- Luffy?! Yeah, I never
heard that name before!

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.290
Remember my name for
the rest of your lives!

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:08.290
I'm the man who's gonna
be King of the Pirates!

00:06:10.130 --> 00:06:12.120
This guy's...

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:16.290
Take him and leave!

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:19.730
Never come here again!

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.400
Run!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:36.890
Well done...

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:39.960
--Hurry!
--Raise the anchor!

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:44.870
I'd expect even you to collapse
after all you just went through...

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:45.990
Say.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.870
What were you mad about earlier?

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:55.210
I hate them. They're wrong.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:01.480
<i>That's not how friends should act.</i>

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:04.850
What're you talking about?
Of course it's not.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:09.060
Pirates aren't the lovely things
you make them out to be.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:12.150
I'd say Captain Kuro's
more standard than you.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.500
I want some meat.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.520
You're unbelievable!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:29.010
Can you keep everything that's
just happened here a secret?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:32.650
Eh?! A secret?! How come?!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:36.580
Yeah! After we just fought
for the village's sake!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.490
Everyone'll change their
opinion of you, too!

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:41.990
You could be the village hero!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.790
--Yeah! Yeah!
--Yeah! Yeah!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:48.200
<i>Usopp-san. You need to clear up
everyone's misunderstanding...</i>

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:54.070
Misunderstanding? I was only called
an exaggerator, like always.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:58.670
There's no need to scare everyone
with something that's already over.

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:03.080
Aside from things like this,

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:09.020
no pirates will show up to attack
a remote village like this one.

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:12.550
I'm just going to pretend
that nothing ever happened.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:16.750
<i>It was all a lie.</i>

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:22.400
I won't force you to, but...

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:26.200
No, I can do it! If it's for
the best of the village!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.370
Me too!

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:31.040
Me too! I'll never say a word, ever!

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.970
Kaya...

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:35.670
Will it be hard for you?

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.410
No.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:47.860
<i>Where is Usopp-kun this morning?</i>

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:52.190
It throws everything off for some reason...
I can't get motivated...

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.430
Mommy...

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.770
Is the liar guy not coming today?

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:00.100
That damn exaggeration-spewing kid...

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.770
Where is he today?!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:06.070
Do you think maybe
I was too harsh yesterday?

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:11.140
He'll be back to his old tricks
come tomorrow! I'm sure of it...

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.550
Thanks!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:21.590
I wouldn't have been able to protect
the village without you guys!

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:23.490
What're you talkin' about?

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:27.260
<i>If you hadn't done anything,
I would've done nothing!</i>

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.860
Me too!

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:34.960
Who cares about that?
I got me some treasure!

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:47.610
This incident has helped me
finally come to a decision.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:12.530
Captain Usopp! What did you
want to talk to us about?!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:19.410
You guys fought well against
those Black Cat Pirates!

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:23.520
As captain, I feel very proud!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:25.020
Y-you're too kind...

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.090
We're nothing compared to you...

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.690
You're embarrassing us!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.460
No, you really did great!

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:36.860
You were scared to death,
but you managed to keep Kaya safe!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.770
We overcame our biggest
and greatest battle since we formed

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:45.310
the Usopp Pirates five years ago,
when you guys were just four!

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:46.240
--Yes!
--Yes!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:52.240
So, I know this is sudden, but I've
decided to set out to sea by myself!

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:59.380
I'm gonna be a real pirate!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:08.930
I had always been unsure if I wanted
to stay here forever or not...

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.530
But, once I saw them,
I finally made up my mind!

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:17.000
<i>I feel that as a man, I must
set out onto the vast ocean!</i>

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:20.340
So I'm leaving this village!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:29.610
There's but one reason:
the pirate flag is calling me!

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:34.680
Captain! You're lying, right?!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.960
You're lying again, right?!

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:42.860
It's way too hasty to do that!
Don't you love this village, Captain?!

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:46.530
What'll happen to the Usopp Pirates?!

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:51.040
You've been great to me, guys...

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:55.910
I plan to leave without telling
the villagers. Give them my regards.

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:57.310
No...

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:59.150
I don't want to!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.980
Don't go, Captain!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:07.090
Do you remember this place?

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:11.080
This is where we first met.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.270
All done!

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.940
Liar guy!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:24.540
Who're you guys?!
Don't treat me all buddy-like!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:26.410
But you're famous!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:29.240
Yeah, you're a famous person...

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:30.280
I see!

00:12:30.280 --> 00:12:35.250
So, people've finally started to
respectfully call me Captain Usopp!

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:38.450
Everyone calls you Liar Usopp!

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:43.960
Alright! From this day forth,
you're members of the Usopp Pirates!

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.130
--Eh?!
--Eh?!

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.420
Don't give me that!

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:52.000
A lot's happened, huh?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:56.040
A Cerberus! Scare it away!

00:12:56.040 --> 00:13:00.010
A dragon! Capture it!

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.980
Flour Star!

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:04.280
You're amazing, Captain!

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:09.650
<i>But of course!
I am a brave warrior of the sea!</i>

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:12.750
We don't wanna hear about the old days!

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.990
Yeah! We don't wanna hear about that!

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:20.430
<i>This isn't like you, Captain!
Why are you saying this stuff now?!</i>

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:23.600
It's almost like you're...

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:27.590
You're so stupid, Captain! Stupid!

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.740
What are your ambitions in life?!

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:40.750
To run a pub!

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.280
To be a master carpenter!

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:45.690
To be a novel writer!

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:50.390
T-then swear here that you'll
continue on each of your paths

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:56.600
and never let the fires
of your ambitions go out!

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:59.200
As of today...

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:02.930
...the Usopp Pirates...

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.580
...are disbanded!

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:17.710
"Food"

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.860
Well, we've eaten.
We should get going now.

00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:24.420
Yeah...

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.190
Here you are!

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:28.530
Hey, Miss!

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:30.260
Are you alright, being out of bed?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.420
Yes...

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:35.200
My sickness this past year

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:39.640
was caused by the mental dismay
from having lost my parents...

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:43.540
<i>And Usopp-san really
cheered me up, too...</i>

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:47.110
I can't stay coddled forever!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:51.420
You've done so much
for me. Thank you.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:57.190
I've prepared a present for you
from the bottom of my heart!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:59.590
Please accept it!

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:11.140
All packed...

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:17.170
Guess it's farewell to this house, too!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:34.430
Alright...

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:39.330
What?!

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:46.400
What the...
I can't get out!

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.030
Darn it!

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.550
A caravel!

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.330
Can we really have this?!

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:17.070
Yes, please use it!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:23.410
It's a slightly older model,
but I personally designed it!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:30.250
A carvel-make caravel, with lateen
sails and a central stern rudder...

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:34.220
...the Going Merry!

00:16:34.220 --> 00:16:36.120
Let me explain the running rigging!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:39.330
First, about the Kruger
net yard adjustment-

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:43.430
No, no! You can explain
the ship stuff to me!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:49.100
What a good ship! Especially
this front - it's so cool!

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:52.940
We've loaded it with everything
you might need on a voyage.

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:55.810
Thanks! It leaves nothing
to beat tired!

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:58.210
That's, "Leaves nothing
to be desired," you idiot.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.020
Stop this thing!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.420
<i>Usopp-san!</i>

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:07.950
What's he doing?

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:12.220
Let's just stop him for now.
He's on a collision course with the ship.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.160
T-thanks...

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.930
Sure thing.

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:24.370
<i>So you are taking
to the ocean, Usopp-san?</i>

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:29.000
Yeah. I've decided to get going
before I start to change my mind.

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:31.810
Don't stop me, now.

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:34.920
I won't. I could just tell somehow.

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.720
That's kind of sad, too!

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:39.920
The next time I come to this village,

00:17:39.920 --> 00:17:44.860
I'll tell you adventure stories that
seem even more lie-like than lies!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.730
Okay! I look forward to it!

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:51.770
You guys take care, too!
Let's meet again sometime!

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:52.670
How come?

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:57.400
Huh? How come?
Man, you're antisocial...

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:01.880
I'm gonna be a pirate too, so we'll
meet on the high seas eventually!

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:04.640
What're you talkin' about?
Get on already.

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.610
Eh?!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:09.140
We're friends now, aren't we?

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:19.260
I...

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:21.490
I get to be captain, right?!

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.520
<i>Don't be dumb! I'm the captain!</i>

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:47.950
There goes the captain...

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:52.460
Yeah. But he's with those guys,
so I feel less worried now.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:56.400
Yeah. I've never seen anyone
as strong as them before.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.530
Guess it can't be helped.

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:00.370
He always talked about how
he wanted to be a pirate.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:03.140
The villagers'll probably be
sad when we tell them, though...

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:08.940
It's all so sudden, plus he livened
things up all by himself...

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:13.710
I just had an idea!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.220
--What is it?!
--What is it?!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:19.490
They were certainly pleasant people...

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:20.450
Merry...

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.220
Yes?

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:25.260
Lying hurts...

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.790
Are you referring to Klahadore?

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:29.600
No...

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:34.590
<i>You mean how you really wanted
to stop Usopp-kun from going?</i>

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:45.010
Miss, the villagers once told me
a story from his childhood.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:50.250
<i>Shortly after Usopp-kun's
father left the village,</i>

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:53.450
his mother passed away.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:20:00.590
Pirates are here!!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:02.900
Pirates are here!

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:03.930
Dad's pirates are here!

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:08.200
H-hold on, Usopp!
You mustn't shout!

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:11.500
Dad came back for us!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:17.010
D-don't be silly... Usopp...

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:23.280
But he said he'd take us with
him when you get better, Mom!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:27.620
Your father won't be coming back...

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:34.190
But... I'm proud I married him...

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:38.870
T-there's a legendary medicine!
It can cure any sickness!

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:43.300
You're so silly...
You dream too much...

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:51.380
<i>I don't care if I'm silly! I do dream!
I am the son of a pirate!</i>

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:57.540
Grow up to be a brave man
like your father...

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:07.960
Pirates are here!

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:09.830
Perhaps out of his loneliness,

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.500
he continued to shout it out
after his mother's death.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:19.740
In the hopes that one day his father's
pirate ship would be at the shore,

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:23.440
in the hopes that one day he
would come back for him...

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:32.290
The villagers say that lie of his
also contains his wish.

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:35.690
Pirates!

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:39.090
As someone who lost his own
parents in this village,

00:21:39.090 --> 00:21:44.660
he probably couldn't ignore you,
seeing as the same happened to you.

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:49.140
You will need to grow stronger now, too!

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:53.440
To live up to everything
he's done until today!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.370
Yes!

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:05.210
Cheers to our new ship and crewmate!

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:14.760
They said they were
fighting to live, not die.

00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:19.300
<i>Usopp-san's lies always spoke
about the joy of living.</i>

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:22.000
They cheered me up
and told me to live!

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:24.200
Indeed.

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:25.670
Here we go!

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:27.540
Are we really gonna do this?!

00:22:27.540 --> 00:22:31.440
You bet! We're following
in our captain's footsteps!

00:22:31.440 --> 00:22:33.940
--Ready...
--Ready...

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:43.260
--Pirates are here!
--Pirates are here!

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:49.100
You know what, Merry?
I'm going to be a doctor!

00:22:49.100 --> 00:22:52.430
That's a wonderful goal to have!

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:37.070
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:45.550
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:52.630
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.630 --> 00:24:02.620
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
